Primitive package fixtures

System/Directory.curry and TestDirectory.curry are from the directory CPM
package. System/Process.curry is from process. System/FilePath.curry and
Data/Time.curry are the filepath and time dependencies distributed with
PAKCS 3.10.0's CPM vendor tree. The corresponding LICENSE files are beside
these fixtures. Sources are unchanged apart from trailing whitespace and generic filepath
comment examples, whose home-directory paths are replaced by neutral paths.

PrimitiveIO.curry is Sprite's integration fixture. The unit runner adapts
only TestDirectory's Test.Prop.returns to IO Bool, because the standard
library's returns is a CurryCheck placeholder. The upstream test actions
and expected results are retained.
